  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Return Counselling and Assistance for Voluntary Return from the Swiss Federal Asylum Centers (RAZ)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to provide support to migrants willing to return voluntarily to their countries of origin and prepare their voluntary return movement and reintegration in countries of origin. This is achieved through information provision, counselling on assisted voluntary return, as well as direct assistance throughout the entire return process. IOM return counsellors are present in the Federal Asylum Centres with procedure in Basel, Altst&#xe4;tten, Chiasso and Boudry, in Federal Asylum centers without procedure in Giffers, Glaubenberg, Brugg and Kreuzlingen and equally cover the asylum shelters in the transit area of the international airports in Zurich and Geneva.</narrative>
  </description>
